   "source": [
    "# SubgraphGNN — Colab Setup\n",
    "\n",
    "Runs SubgraphGNN training and the autonomous autoresearch loop on a free T4 GPU.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Note:** The data link in Step 1 expires in ~6 days. If it's expired, mount Google Drive and extract from `TrimNN_data.tar.gz` instead."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Step 1 — Download data"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import os\n",
    "\n",
    "# Download and extract the tissue graph data (181MB compressed, 2.9GB extracted)\n",
    "!wget -q --show-progress https://filebin.net/trimnn-1785466159/TrimNN_data.tar.gz -O /tmp/TrimNN_data.tar.gz\n",
    "os.makedirs('/content/TrimNN', exist_ok=True)\n",
    "!tar -xzf /tmp/TrimNN_data.tar.gz -C /content/TrimNN/\n",
    "print('intestinalOutputs:', os.path.isdir('/content/TrimNN/intestinalOutputs'))\n",
    "print('demo_data:', os.path.isdir('/content/TrimNN/demo_data'))"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Step 2 — Clone repo"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "!git clone https://github.com/Lotion-3/SubgraphGNN.git /content/SubgraphGNN\n",
    "\n",
    "# Symlink so ../TrimNN/intestinalOutputs relative paths work from /content/SubgraphGNN/\n",
    "if not os.path.exists('/content/TrimNN'):\n",
    "    os.symlink('/content/TrimNN', '/content/TrimNN')\n",
    "\n",
    "print('Repo cloned. GPU:', end=' ')\n",
    "import torch; print(torch.cuda.get_device_name(0) if torch.cuda.is_available() else 'NOT AVAILABLE — Runtime > Change runtime type > T4 GPU')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Step 3 — Install dependencies"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "!pip install igraph anthropic -q\n",
    "print('Done.')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Step 4 — Add your Anthropic API key\n",
    "\n",
    "In the left sidebar, click the **key icon (Secrets)** → add a secret named `ANTHROPIC_API_KEY`."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "from google.colab import userdata\n",
    "import os\n",
    "os.environ['ANTHROPIC_API_KEY'] = userdata.get('ANTHROPIC_API_KEY')\n",
    "print('API key loaded:', bool(os.environ['ANTHROPIC_API_KEY']))"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Step 5 — Run the autoresearch loop\n",
    "\n",
    "Claude autonomously proposes experiments, trains for 5 min on T4, keeps improvements, reverts regressions.\n",
    "~100 experiments per 12h session. Stop anytime with the stop button — best result is always preserved in git."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "%cd /content/SubgraphGNN\n",
    "!python3 research_loop.py"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Step 6 — Save results to Drive (run after loop or periodically)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "from google.colab import drive\n",
    "drive.mount('/content/drive')\n",
    "\n",
    "import shutil, os\n",
    "save_dir = '/content/drive/MyDrive/SubgraphGNN_results'\n",
    "os.makedirs(save_dir, exist_ok=True)\n",
    "shutil.copy('/content/SubgraphGNN/trimnn_model.pt', save_dir)\n",
    "shutil.copy('/content/SubgraphGNN/results.tsv', save_dir)\n",
    "print('Saved to Drive:', save_dir)"
   ]
  }
 ]
}"
